oast, Foothill and Sierra added (census of 2026-10-11). Earlier: SkyTamarack (S392) through the Supabase MCP: El Camino and San Joaquin Delta added (Delta's row names no catalog year; its records carry 2026-2027 from the catalog menu, S391). Earlier: SkyPersimmon (S389) through the Supabase MCP: Southwestern and Fresno City added. Earlier: SkyHazel (S385) through the Supabase MCP: Modesto Junior and Palo Verde added. Earlier: SkySpruce (S383) through the Supabase MCP: Cabrillo added; Bakersfield and Coastline re-read, unchanged. Earlier: SkyRowan (S381) through the Supabase MCP: Bakersfield and Coastline added; San Diego Mesa re-read, unchanged. Earlier: SkyCypress (S373) through the Supabase MCP: San Diego Mesa added. Earlier: SkyLaurel (S369) through the Supabase MCP: Chaffey and San Diego City added. Earlier: SkyCedar (S363) through the Supabase MCP: Long Beach City added. Earlier: SkyFern (S358) through the Supabase MCP: Moreno Valley and Norco added; Riverside City re-read, unchanged. Earlier: SkyLedger (S340) through the Supabase MCP: all seven rows read; the pilot's five unchanged since 2026-10-04, Santa Monica and Irvine Valley added",
